Migration notes for the next tickets (fuma-nama/fumadocs CHANGELOGs):

fumadocs-mdx v11 -> v15 (skips v12-14 entirely):
- v12: page data renames (`_file`->`info`, `absolutePath`->`fullPath`),
  Zod 3 support dropped, `content` field removed (use `getText()`).
- v13: `createMDXSource`/`resolveFiles` moved out of fumadocs-mdx; Vite
  output moved to `.source/index.ts`; new Plugins API.
- v14: `postInstall()` now takes an options object; `getDefaultMDXOptions()`
  replaced by `applyMdxPreset()`; `lastModifiedTime` option replaced by a
  `lastModified` plugin; multi-dir collections dropped; automatic
  `extractedReferences` disabled by default.
- v15: ESM-only Next config required; min fumadocs-core raised to
