  and `src/lib/source.ts`'s `from '@/.source'` import both still target
  the old `index.ts` and will need updating.

fumadocs-core/ui v15 -> v16:
- Removed `fumadocs-core/sidebar`.
- `fumadocs-core/server` reorganized into `fumadocs-core/content/github`,
