- Shiki now defaults to the JS regex engine (`experimentalJSEngine` ->
  `engine: 'js' | 'oniguruma'`).
- Requires React >=19.2.0; fumadocs-ui now requires Next 16.
- Removed deprecated `DocsCategory`, old search signatures, legacy i18n
  middleware paths.
- Search engine migrated from Orama to ZBSearch (APIs unchanged; custom
  Orama tokenizers need ZBSearch equivalents).

fumadocs-typescript v4 -> v5:
- v4: `createGenerator()` replaces direct `generateDocumentation(...)`
  calls; `remarkAutoTypeTable` takes a generator in its options;
  `createTypeTable()` replaced by an `AutoTypeTable` component taking a
